news/nvidia-nvda-stock-news-october-19-2026/","https://infostockdaily.co.kr/news/articleView.html?idxno=218541","https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/corporate-news/morgan-stanley-raises-target-for-duke-energy-stock-to-usd-128/70392665"]}],"days":[{"s":"2026-10-22","e":"2026-10-22","why":"모건스탠리가 전날 목표주가를 올린 데 이어 HSBC도 이날 평가를 내놓았다. 같은 날 미국 증시는 메타의 AI 설비투자 부담과 잉여현금흐름 적자 전환 여파로 기술주·반도체주가 급락했다(S&P 500 -1.2%).","src":["https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/corporate-news/morgan-stanley-raises-target-for-duke-energy-stock-to-usd-128/70392665","https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/corporate-news/duke-energy-stock-hsbc-sets-a-usd-123-00-target-for-duke-energy-stock/70394851","https://infostockdaily.co.kr/news/articleView.html?idxno=218541"],"short":"모건스탠리 목표주가 상향·기술주 급락"},{"s":"2026-07-02","e":"2026-07-02","why":"원인 보도 확인 안 됨","src":[]},{"s":"2026-08-10","e":"2026-08-10","why":"원인 보도 확인 안 됨","src":[]},{"s":"2026-07-06","e":"2026-07-06","why":"원인 보도 확인 안 됨","src":[]},{"s":"2026-05-15","e":"2026-05-15","why":"원인 보도 확인 안 됨","src":[]}]}}